      "updatedAt": "2026-07-05T15:39:59.865Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-07-05T15:39:59.865Z"
    },
    "c28": {
      "id": "c28",
      "num": 28,
      "title": "HTML mockups (live sandboxed iframe previews)",
      "body": "UX/UI design cards can carry a **live, clickable** HTML mockup: a link to `/mockups/<board>/<name>.html` in the body renders as a sandboxed iframe (`allow-scripts allow-forms`, no same-origin) in the panel — card face shows a 🖼 chip. Files at `docs/kanban/mockups/<board>/`, served at `/mockups/…`, shared `_base.css` for on-brand tokens. Author from scratch (self-contained, inline data/fonts-with-fallbacks), link via `kb mockup` / shim `mockup()`. Reference: discovery board (#2/#3/#4 bakeoff = star-web/tech-tree/journal). Pattern in SKILL 'HTML mockups on cards'.",
      "labels": [
